2567732, PubMed:33130824). Plays an important role in the maintenance of the MICOS complex stability and the mitochondrial cristae morphology (PubMed:25781180, PubMed:32567732, PubMed:33130824). Has also been shown to function as a transcription factor which binds to the BAG1 promoter and represses BAG1 transcription (PubMed:22567091)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}